<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<section xml:id="sec-Cmaj-drop2-cycle2" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Drop 2 Diatonic 7th Chords — C Major, Roots Ascending in 2nds (Cycle 2)</title>

  <p>
    Descending Drop 2 seventh chords from the C major scale with roots ascending
    by step (cycle of 2nds). Each voicing is arranged for minimal movement and
    best voice leading. Initial sequence: <m>CGBE \to CFAD \to BEGD \to AEFC
    \to GDFB \to GCEA \to FBDA \to EBCG</m>.
  </p>

  <!-- ===== Row 1: Chords 1–4 ===== -->
  <sidebyside widths="22% 22% 22% 22%" margins="3%">

